     {
      "id": "no_rain_600s_exponential",
      "description": "DRYING branch over a 600 s moisture step (dump run_fmc_rain/esm_dump_fmc_2.json, cell 1), the rain-free control for the four wetting tests above and, in its own right, the first test of the EXPONENTIAL update on the drying side: change = 0.1667 for the 1-h class and 0.0167 for the 10-h class, both above TOL = 1e-2, while every existing moisture test has change <= 1.4e-4 and takes the Taylor branch. Same 2 m forcing as moisture_run_step20_timber_grass_understory, so emc_d, emc_w and rlag match that test exactly and only the step length differs. real32: rel 1e-5.",
